    "chunk_text": "& geeode Persipulis \u00fea burg heora cynestol, seo is giet welegast ealra burga. \u00dea sede man Alexandre \u00fe\u00e6t Darius h\u00e6fde gebunden his agene m\u00e6gas mid gyldenre racentan. \u00dea for he wi\u00f0 his mid siex hund monna, & funde hiene \u00e6nne be wege licgan, mid sperum tosticad, He \u00fea Alexander him anum deadum lytle mildheortnesse gedyde, \u00fe\u00e6t he hiene hett bebyrgean an Unea\u00f0e m\u00e6g mon to geleafsuman gesecgan swa monigfeald yfel swa on \u00f0\u00e6m \u00ferim gearum \u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6ron fieftiene hund \u00feusend monna \u00fe\u00e6t binnan \u00fe\u00e6m forwurdon. & of \u00fe\u00e6m ilcan folcum forwurdon lytle \u00e6r, swa hit her beforan s\u00e6g\u00f0, nigantiene hund M monna, \u00de\u00e6t is \u00fe\u00e6t Asirie eall seo \u00feeod awest wear\u00f0 from Alexandre, & monega byrig on Asiam, & Tirus Nales \u00fe\u00e6t an \u00fe\u00e6t heora twegea gewinn \u00fea w\u00e6re on \u00f0\u00e6m eastende \u00feisses middangeardes; ac & Alexander, Epira cyning, \u00fe\u00e6s miclan Alexanderes eam se wilnade \u00fe\u00e6s westd\u00e6les swa se o\u00f0er & on \u00fe\u00e6re ilcan tide Zoffirion, Ponto cyning, in Sci\u00fe\u00feie mid firde gefor, & he & his folc mid ealle Alexander \u00e6fter Darius dea\u00fee gewonn ealle Mandos, & ealle Ircaniam. & on \u00f0\u00e6re hwile \u00fee he \u00fe\u00e6r winnende w\u00e6s, frefelice hiene gesohte Minotheo, seo Sci\u00fe\u00feisce cwen, \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m wonn Alexander wi\u00f0 Parthim \u00fe\u00e6m folce, & he hie neah ealle forslog & fordyde",
